{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T14:44:36.567Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"PR #43’s body still names an old product head, and PR #34’s body still describes the earlier repair pilot rather than the preindexed protocol. I’m updating both after one review-thread check. I’m using the GitHub review-comments workflow here because PR #43 has a Bugbot review that may contain an inline issue not visible in the summary.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
