{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T15:34:46.340Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The cohort audit also found a real evaluation-design gap: the current three-repo selector never verifies candidates against the protected 1,221-repository exclusion union. I’ll fix that in the harness after the product head is corrected. For now, the Graph fixes are underway in parallel; I’m handling bounded agent output, useful query telemetry, index partial-failure reporting, and capability discovery.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
