{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T15:48:21.478Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The full repository check is green after the review fix: formatting, vet, build, and race tests all passed. The independent reviewer’s only finding was that the new telemetry header could crowd out the top result at a 64-byte budget; that is now fixed with compact fallback telemetry and a regression. I’m committing and pushing this product checkpoint now.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
