{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:03:10.057Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"Graph PR #43 is now fully green: all seven lint/build/test checks passed across Linux, macOS, and Windows at `d5b8c49`. The cohort freezer is in implementation with synthetic tests. Separately, I’m wiring the realistic smoke task as issue-driven codebase analysis—public issue text, unconstrained agent tool choice, sealed relevant-source qrels—so it measures how Codex/Claude/Cursor actually investigate a change, without pretending retrieval qrels prove a patch.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
