e cases: `competitive-eval/results-agentic/latest-live-full-evidence-token-v3/scores.jsonl`.\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:214:  `/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot` at `d2f13dc`, draft PR #34.\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:216:  the previous CI run had an inherited frozen-V8 closure failure. The new head\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:227:  - `python3 -m py_compile competitive-eval/tools/agentic_parity.py\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:228:    tests/test_agentic_parity.py` passed after adding the live parity harness.\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:232:  `/Users/thomi/Projects/brain-bench/competitive-eval/results-agentic/latest-live-full-fixed-20260707-v3`.\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:325:  `/Users/thomi/Projects/brain-bench/competitive-eval/results-agentic/latest-live-miss-cleanup-entire-only-scoped-v4`\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:436:- Source: `/Users/thomi/Projects/brain-bench/competitive-eval/results/agentic-live.md`\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:449:  `/Users/thomi/Projects/brain-bench/competitive-eval/results-agentic/latest-live-full-fixed-20260707-v3`\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:451:  `/Users/thomi/Projects/brain-bench/competitive-eval/tools/agentic_parity.py`\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:453:  - `python3 competitive-eval/tools/agentic_parity.py run --mode live --fresh\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidence-ledger.md:457:    competitive-eval/results-agentic/latest-live-full-fixed-20260707-v3`\n/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-plan/paper/entire-toolchain/evidenc