{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:14:39.255Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The replacement pool is now concrete and local: the exact pinned SWE-rebench V2 parquet (32,079 predefined software-engineering tasks, SHA-256 verified) is already present. The revised freezer will read repository identity/count metadata only, HMAC-filter before disclosure, and defer issue text plus gold patch locations to the sealed materialization stage. That preserves the “existing predefined test set” requirement without opening V8.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
