{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:33:18.780Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_019f7613-37bb-7010-8bad-0135f6a0507b","author":"/root/swe_cohort_freezer","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/swe_cohort_freezer\nPayload:\nCompleted the SWE-rebench V2 cohort freezer update.\n\nKey guarantees:\n\n- Uses only `instance_id`, `repo`, and `language`.\n- Exact pinned parquet SHA/schema/32,079-row contract.\n- Logical path is `data/train-00000-of-00001.parquet`.\n- HMAC-checks every identity-bearing row before eligibility.\n- Preserves every prior/protected/post-freeze/repair-pilot exclusion.\n- Selects three distinct languages, then one repository per language using secret-keyed ranks.\n- Preserves selected `repo` spelling byte-for-byte.\n- Fails closed on byte-distinct aliases for one normalized repository.\n- No exclusion bypass in the production CLI.\n- All paid, execution, scoring, repair, confirmatory, and publication authorities remain false.\n- Canonical exclusive no-overwrite freeze and recomputing validation remain enforced.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Focused tests: `24 passed`\n- Adjacent Graph V8/HMAC/artifact tests: `61 passed`\n- `py_compile`: passed\n\nRemaining: the actual pinned-parquet/protected-key freeze was deliberately not run, per instruction. No code issue remains in my owned files."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
