{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:33:18.780Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_019f7613-37bc-7132-9da0-80afe031e4e1","author":"/root/issue_materializer","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/issue_materializer\nPayload:\nImplemented and audited the SWE‑rebench V2 issue-analysis materializer.\n\n- Exact pinned dataset/parquet metadata enforced.\n- Deterministic one-case-per-repository selection.\n- Public tasks contain queries only—no patches, qrels, answers, ranks, scores, outcomes, touched paths, or source instance IDs.\n- Patch-derived locations remain sealed and marked inaccessible to agents.\n- Offline validation recomputes all source, cohort, checkout, public, sealed, and attestation bindings.\n- Atomic no-overwrite publication supports recovery only from byte-exact partial output.\n- All model, paid, repair, scoring, confirmatory, and publication authorities remain false.\n- No model or paid execution performed.\n\nTests: `9 passed`; compilation and whitespace checks clean.\n\nFiles:\n\n- `competitive-eval/tools/materialize_agentic_issue_analysis_smoke.py`\n- `competitive-eval/tools/test_materialize_agentic_issue_analysis_smoke.py`\n\nNo commit created."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
