{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:34:34.100Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bab1a1c6c8191bc142cbd83d541e6","status":"completed","call_id":"call_svU0ic1V8y4a8LfkX6QQyRCI","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"/private/tmp/graph-v7-toolchain-venv/bin/python competitive-eval/tools/freeze_agentic_issue_analysis_smoke.py --help && /private/tmp/graph-v7-toolchain-venv/bin/python competitive-eval/tools/freeze_agentic_issue_analysis_smoke.py freeze --help && ls -l /private/tmp/swe-rebench-v2-550a7d2a-0000.parquet /private/tmp/graph-v8-protected/exclusion-hmac-key.bin competitive-eval/graph-v8/graph-exclusion-freeze.json\",\n  workdir: \"/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot\",\n  yield_time_ms: 10000,\n  max_output_tokens: 20000\n});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:34:34.397Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019f7614-5f1d-7b31-bb2a-7a54d5f30160","call_id":"call_svU0ic1V8y4a8LfkX6QQyRCI","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"usage: freeze_agentic_issue_analysis_smoke.py [-h] {freeze,validate} ...\n\nFreeze an identity-safe, unpaid three-repository issue-analysis smoke. The\nselector consumes only identity/count metadata projected from the pinned SWE-\nrebench V2 parquet. Every source repository is checked against the protected\nGraph V8 HMAC union before selection or publication. The public artifact\ncontains only aggregate exclusion counts and the three selected public\nrepository identities/languages. It contains no task text, patch, qrel,\nexpected answer, repair oracle, rank, score, or outcome data and grants no\nexecution or publication authority. Selection is a single, outcome-blind\nfreeze. Eligible repositories have at least six unique source instances and\nexactly one language. The keyed selector first chooses three distinct\nlanguages, then one repository within each. This development smoke cannot\nsupport a confirmatory code-repair or broad product superiority claim.\n\npositional arguments:\n  {freeze,validate}\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help         show this help message and exit\nusage: freeze_agentic_issue_analysis_smoke.py freeze [-h]\n                                                     --source-parquet SOURCE_PARQUET\n                                                     [--prior-spike PRIOR_SPIKE]\n                                                     [--prior-spike-sha256 PRIOR_SPIKE_SHA256]\n                                                     [--exclusions EXCLUSIONS]\n                                                     [--exclusions-sha256 EXCLUSIONS_SHA256]\n                                                     --identity-key IDENTITY_KEY\n                                                     [--post-freeze-cohort POST_FREEZE_COHORT]\n                                                     --output OUTPUT\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --source-parquet SOURCE_PARQUET\n  --prior-spike PRIOR_SPIKE\n  --prior-spike-sha256 PRIOR_SPIKE_SHA256\n  --exclusions EXCLUSIONS\n  --exclusions-sha256 EXCLUSIONS_SHA256\n  --identity-key IDENTITY_KEY\n  --post-freeze-cohort POST_FREEZE_COHORT\n                        supplement (never replace) the mandatory default\n                        public cohorts\n  --output OUTPUT\n-rw-------@ 1 thomi  wheel         32 Jul 15 10:59 /private/tmp/graph-v8-protected/exclusion-hmac-key.bin\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 thomi  wheel  428839266 Jul 15 08:05 /private/tmp/swe-rebench-v2-550a7d2a-0000.parquet\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 thomi  wheel      83269 Jul 17 14:58 competitive-eval/graph-v8/graph-exclusion-freeze.json\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
