{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:35:25.128Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The first real freeze exposed one more protocol bug: SWE-rebench contains a small class of byte-distinct repository aliases. I’m fixing the selector to HMAC-check every physical identity, exclude only alias-ambiguous repositories, and continue from the remaining eligible pool. That preserves the leakage boundary and avoids weakening exclusions.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:35:25.128Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bab4d24ec8191a876a270a77aaee0","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The first real freeze exposed one more protocol bug: SWE-rebench contains a small class of byte-distinct repository aliases. I’m fixing the selector to HMAC-check every physical identity, exclude only alias-ambiguous repositories, and continue from the remaining eligible pool. That preserves the leakage boundary and avoids weakening exclusions."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
