{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:35:42.677Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019f7615-69d4-7011-b161-044268a1e9d6","call_id":"call_Zcq9q9E1G25u73MbOxhPOpoE","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"usage: materialize_agentic_issue_analysis_smoke.py [-h]\n                                                   {materialize,validate} ...\n\nMaterialize a sealed, development-only issue-localization smoke. The\nrepository cohort is frozen before this program runs. This program reads only\nrows for those three public repositories from the pinned SWE-rebench V2\nparquet, applies fixed structural eligibility rules, and hash-ranks one case\nper repository before any product or model output exists. Agent-visible tasks\ncontain the issue only. Gold-patch-derived base-snapshot locations are written\nto a separate controller-only artifact. This program does not run a model,\nretrieval system, scorer, or repair agent. It grants no confirmatory or\npublication authority.\n\npositional arguments:\n  {materialize,validate}\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\nusage: materialize_agentic_issue_analysis_smoke.py materialize\n       [-h] --cohort COHORT --cohort-sha256 COHORT_SHA256 --parquet PARQUET\n       [--checkouts-dir CHECKOUTS_DIR] [--public-output PUBLIC_OUTPUT]\n       [--sealed-output SEALED_OUTPUT]\n       [--attestation-output ATTESTATION_OUTPUT]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --cohort COHORT\n  --cohort-sha256 COHORT_SHA256\n  --parquet PARQUET\n  --checkouts-dir CHECKOUTS_DIR\n  --public-output PUBLIC_OUTPUT\n  --sealed-output SEALED_OUTPUT\n  --attestation-output ATTESTATION_OUTPUT\nusage: materialize_agentic_issue_analysis_smoke.py validate\n       [-h] --cohort COHORT --cohort-sha256 COHORT_SHA256 --parquet PARQUET\n       [--checkouts-dir CHECKOUTS_DIR] [--public-output PUBLIC_OUT