mpared to those of Sonnet 4.6 and Opus 4.8 (a","title":"Introducing Claude Sonnet 5 \\ Anthropic","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-sonnet-5"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.anthropic.com","ref_id":"turn8search10","snippet":"# Pricing ... * ## Claude Opus 4 ... * ## Claude Opus 3","title":"Pricing \\ Anthropic","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/pricing?subjects=claude&type=product"}]}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:40:43.983Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019f761a-02cf-70b1-a424-6624bfd1f094","call_id":"call_CISvEskk76D3dxUipF7uOrTg","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Introducing Claude Opus 4.8 \\ Anthropic (https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-4-8?hl=en-US)\nciteturn8search0 [wordlim: 200] Published: last month; Crawled: 4 weeks ago; We’re upgrading Claude Opus to a new version: Claude Opus 4.8. ... It’s available today for the same price. ... Pricing for regular usage is unchanged from Opus 4.7: $5 per million input tokens and $25 per million output tokens.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nClaude Opus \\ Anthropic (https://www.anthropic.com/claude/opus?m=1)\nciteturn8search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: last month; Crawled: 3 days ago; For developers interested in building AI solutions that demand strong intelligence, Opus 4.8 is available on the Claude Platform natively, and in Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Foundry.Pricing for Opus 4.8 starts at $5 per million input tokens and $25 per million output tokens, with up to 90% cost savings with prompt caching and 50% savings with batch processing. ... We offer Claude models across the spectrum of speed, price, and performance.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntroducing Claude Opus 4.8 \\ Anthropic (https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-4-8)\nciteturn8search2 [wordlim: 200] Published: last month; Crawled: last week; Claude Opus 4.8 is available everywhere today.Pricing for regular usage is unchanged from Opus 4.7: $5 per million input tokens and $25 per million output tokens.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAnthropic List Prices — 2026-05-27 (https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/files/4zrzovbb/website/3684c2faafb97418665782cea0001f439f74b1d2.pdf)\nciteturn8search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: last month; \nClaude Model Pricing — List Prices by Platform\nPrices Effective: May 27, 2026 (2026-05-27)\nThis document contains pricing information as of the effective date listed above. All prices are USD per one million tokens\n(MTok) unless otherwise noted. \"—\" indicates the SKU is not offered for that pricing tier / scope / context window\ncombination. Rows marked \"*\" indicate that SKU availability varies by region within the listed scope; not all SKUs in that row\nare offered in every region.\nFor further information on all other feature-, tool- and model-specific pricing visit:\nhttps://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing\nClaude API\n15 model SKUs · prices in USD per 1M tokens\nClaude Opus 4.8 — Claude API\nPRICING T IER St andard | SCOPE Global | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $5.00 | OUT PUT T OKENS $25.00 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $6.25 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $10.00 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.50 --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- PRICING T IER St andard | SCOPE US-only inference | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $5.50 | OUT PUT T OKENS $27.50 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $6.875 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $11.00 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.55 PRICING T IER Batch processing | SCOPE Global | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $2.50 | OUT PUT T OKENS $12.50 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $3.125 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $5.00 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.25 PRICING T IER Batch processing | SCOPE US-only inference | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $2.75 | OUT PUT T OKENS $13.75 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $3.4375 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $5.50 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.275Claude Opus 4.7 — Claude API\nPRICING T IER St andard | SCOPE Global | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $5.00 | OUT PUT T OKENS $25.00 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $6.25 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $10.00 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.50 --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- PRICING T IER St andard | SCOPE US-only inference | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $5.50 | OUT PUT T OKENS $27.50 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $6.875 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $11.00 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.55 PRICING T IER Batch processing | SCOPE Global | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $2.50 | OUT PUT T OKENS $12.50 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $3.125 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $5.00 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.25 PRICING T IER Batch processing | SCOPE US-only inference | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $2.75 | OUT PUT T OKENS $13.75 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $3.4375 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $5.50 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.275Claude Opus 4.6 — Claude API\nPRICING T IER St andard | SCOPE Global | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $5.00 | OUT PUT T OKENS $25.00 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $6.25 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $10.00 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.50 --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- PRICING T IER St andard | SCOPE US-only inference | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $5.50 | OUT PUT T OKENS $27.50 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $6.875 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $11.00 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.55 PRICING T IER Batch processing | SCOPE Global | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $2.50 | OUT PUT T OKENS $12.50 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $3.125 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $5.00 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.25 PRICING T IER Batch processing | SCOPE US-only inference | CONT EXT WINDOW All | BASE INPUT T OKENS $2.75 | OUT PUT T OKENS $13.75 | 5M CACHE WRIT ES $3.4375 | 1H CACHE WRIT ES $5.50 | CACHE HIT S & REFRESHES $0.275Page 1\nClaude Model Pricing--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntroducing Claude Opus 4.8 \\ Anthropic (https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-4-8?ct=13057)\nciteturn8search3 [wordlim: 200] Published: last month; Crawled: 3 days ago; We’re upgrading Claude Opus to a new version: Claude Opus 4.8. ... It’s available today for the same price. ... Pricing for regular usage is unchanged from Opus 4.7: $5 per million input tokens and $25 per million output tokens.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nClaude Opus \\ Anthropic (https://www.anthropic.com/claude/opus?prog_id=5)\nciteturn8search4 [wordlim: 200] Published: last month; Crawled: 3 days ago; For developers interested in building AI solutions that demand strong intelligence, Opus 4.8 is available on the Claude Platform natively, and in Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Foundry.Pricing for Opus 4.8 starts at $5 per million input tokens and $25 per million output tokens, with up to 90% cost savings with prompt caching and 50% savings with batch processing.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntroducing Claude Opus 4.8 \\ Anthropic (https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-4-8?_hsmi=315222514)\nciteturn8search5 [wordlim: 200] Published: last month; Crawled: 3 days ago; Claude Opus 4.8 is available everywhere today.Pricing for regular usage is unchanged from Opus 4.7: $5 per million input tokens and $25 per million output tokens.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPricing - Anthropic (https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/about-claude/pricing?4810b549_page=3&73cdfb14_page=2&939688b5_page=1&e768fcd2_page=2)\nciteturn8search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 10 months ago; Claude Opus 4.1  | $15 / MTok  | $18.75 / MTok  | $30 / MTok  | $1.50 / MTok  | $75 / MTok ...   * 5-minute cache write tokens are 1.25 times the base input tokens price ... It follows the standard input and output token pricing based on the Claude model you’re using.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nClaude Model Pricing — All Platforms (https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/files/4zrzovbb/website/5678bc2f5978e5bcd4f1fe7c14b2c72284dcf9f8.pdf)\nciteturn8search13 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2 months ago; \nClaude Model Pricing — List Prices by Platform\nPrices Effective: May 12, 202