{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:49:24.490Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The product audit just found the next genuine Graph defect before any paid run: even after preindexing, warm HEAD search can spend seconds rereading files and rebuilding a selective graph. On the Graph repository itself it measured about 23.4s warm; this directly explains earlier latency losses. I’m stopping the execution freeze here and fixing that product path first—this is exactly the “find flaws, improve Entire Graph” loop you asked for.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:49:24.490Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bae94725081918fc0320e0d6da8da","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The product audit just found the next genuine Graph defect before any paid run: even after preindexing, warm HEAD search can spend seconds rereading files and rebuilding a selective graph. On the Graph repository itself it measured about 23.4s warm; this directly explains earlier latency losses. I’m stopping the execution freeze here and fixing that product path first—this is exactly the “find flaws, improve Entire Graph” loop you asked for."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
