{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:56:06.869Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The audit expanded that into six concrete product issues, and I’ve split the fixes cleanly:\n\n- the warm-search worker is removing full-repo rereads/re-resolution, fixing filesystem-order usage scans, and adding honest scan telemetry;\n- the agent-output worker is fixing ranking pollution, preserving production neighbors ahead of test callers, surfacing degraded indexes, and enforcing exact byte caps;\n- the benchmark runner remains unpaid and is now binding clean build provenance, preindex reuse, structured answers, pricing, and the scorer.\n\nThe benchmark remains paused until these product fixes are tested and pushed.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T16:56:06.869Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bb026d7308191a6ab18470a14e634","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The audit expanded that into six concrete product issues, and I’ve split the fixes cleanly:\n\n- the warm-search worker is removing full-repo rereads/re-resolution, fixing filesystem-order usage scans, and adding honest scan telemetry;\n- the agent-output worker is fixing ranking pollution, preserving production neighbors ahead of test callers, surfacing degraded indexes, and enforcing exact byte caps;\n- the benchmark runner remains unpaid and is now binding clean build provenance, preindex reuse, structured answers, pricing, and the scorer.\n\nThe benchmark remains paused until these product fixes are tested and pushed."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
