{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T17:11:21.426Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"I’m continuing on the two remaining fronts: the warm-search engine defect in Entire Graph and the sealed, resumable benchmark runner. The first bounded-output retrieval fixes are already committed and pushed; I’m now reviewing the deeper cache/query fix, rerunning full checks and latency measurements, then I’ll push that checkpoint before freezing any benchmark inputs. No paid run will start without the exact-hash authorization gate.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
