{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T17:11:21.483Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019f7636-0c8b-7042-9789-da1956f28a53","call_id":"call_Y9hDB9iWYj65n3yTo7FixVqy","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/agent_output_fix\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Implemented and validated the agent-facing product fixes.\\n\\nChanged:\\n\\n- `internal/cli/search.go`\\n- `internal/cli/neighbors.go`\\n- `internal/cli/root.go`\\n- `internal/cli/search_agent_test.go`\\n- `internal/cli/neighbors_efficiency_test.go`\\n- `internal/cli/root_test.go`\\n\\nKey outcomes:\\n\\n- Search now reserves warning/partial-failure/completeness markers under exact byte caps.\\n- Tight search output preserves the top focus location and reports only the displayed span.\\n- Neighbor ranking prioritizes production/internal edges over tests and externals, then resolution, confidence, path, and name.\\n- Added positive `neighbors --max-context-bytes`, defaulting to 16 KiB.\\n- Bounded neighbor output preserves focus, coverage, and truncation markers without exceeding the cap.\\n- Depth-2 output avoids repeating full endpoint locations.\\n- Added the 20-test-callers versus one-production-caller regression.\\n- Added 1–20 byte cap regressions and help coverage.\\n- Search’s byte-cap flag now rejects zero.\\n\\nValidation passed:\\n\\n- Focused: `go test ./internal/cli -run 'AgentSearch|Neighbor' -count=1`\\n- Full CLI package: `go test ./internal/cli`\\n- `git diff --check`\\n\\nNo commit or push performed.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/neighbors_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/warm_search_fix\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
