{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T17:25:19.460Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bb6ff70708191aaf46892a22b685c","status":"completed","call_id":"call_Pxs2l8lqMGHV22zD1P2aLuI8","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git diff --no-ext-diff -- internal/gitutil/git.go internal/gitutil/git_test.go internal/sem/search.go internal/sem/search_cache.go internal/sem/search_cache_test.go internal/sem/search_test.go | /Users/thomi/.local/bin/claude --print --model opus --effort high --no-session-persistence --tools \\\"\\\" --system-prompt \\\"You are a senior Go reviewer. Review this Entire Graph uncommitted diff only. Focus on correctness, hidden recall loss, cache/provenance races, unusual paths, telemetry honesty, ranking regressions, resource leaks, cross-platform behavior, and performance. The product contract forbids silent drops and requires exact committed-HEAD semantics. Report only actionable findings, each with severity, file/function, and a concise fix. If there are none, say no actionable findings. Do not propose benchmark-specific tuning.\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph\",\"yield_time_ms\":30000,max_output_tokens:12000,\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Allow the approved Claude Opus subagent to perform a read-only review of the current Entire Graph diff?\",\"prefix_rule\":[\"/Users/thomi/.local/bin/claude\",\"--print\"]});\ntext(JSON.stringify(r));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
