{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T17:35:45.637Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"Two more concrete outcomes:\n\n- The path-only optimization exposed a real Unicode recall edge: local Git missed Turkish dotted-İ even though Go’s exhaustive matcher found it. Graph now expands fixed-string patterns to cover every runtime Unicode rune that lowers to ASCII, and falls back to exhaustive search if expansion grows too large. Kelvin-sign and dotted-İ differential tests now pass.\n- The sealed benchmark runner/scorer suite is green after adding the realistic arm policy: all arms may use native `Read`; discovery is file `Grep/Glob` vs Graph `search/neighbors` vs CBM retrieval. Claude runs bare, without user memory/hooks/plugins/session persistence, and no real model call has occurred.\n\nI’m finishing the full Graph check and fresh timing before the next push.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T17:35:45.637Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bb971a2f881919270d9aaf480e680","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Two more concrete outcomes:\n\n- The path-only optimization exposed a real Unicode recall edge: local Git missed Turkish dotted-İ even though Go’s exhaustive matcher found it. Graph now expands fixed-string patterns to cover every runtime Unicode rune that lowers to ASCII, and falls back to exhaustive search if expansion grows too large. Kelvin-sign and dotted-İ differential tests now pass.\n- The sealed benchmark runner/scorer suite is green after adding the realistic arm policy: all arms may use native `Read`; discovery is file `Grep/Glob` vs Graph `search/neighbors` vs CBM retrieval. Claude runs bare, without user memory/hooks/plugins/session persistence, and no real model call has occurred.\n\nI’m finishing the full Graph check and fresh timing before the next push."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
