{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T17:39:27.450Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019f764f-c65a-72b2-b053-42bd6a47fd1e","call_id":"call_TId544fgj8qZj2P2s8vnjZNV","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/neighbors_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/warm_diff_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/warm_search_fix\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Completed both follow-up fixes; patch is ready for review and commit.\\n\\nImplemented:\\n\\n- Dedicated `git grep -l -z` committed-tree path API.\\n  - NUL-safe unusual paths.\\n  - Exact commit treeish.\\n  - Empty/no-hit behavior.\\n  - Equivalent path set to the existing text-match API.\\n  - Shallow committed preselection and identifier postings now use the path-only API.\\n- Exact committed provenance.\\n  - Resolve `HEAD` once.\\n  - Resolve tree from that commit hash.\\n  - List files, read blobs, and load `.gitignore` from the same immutable revision.\\n  - Search compares both commit and tree before returning.\\n  - Cache build rejects a snapshot if HEAD moved during construction.\\n- Unicode recall closure.\\n  - Confirmed a real false negative: Turkish dotted `İssueNeedle` matched exhaustive Go lowering but not local Git `-i`.\\n  - Fixed by generating exact UTF-8 alternatives from the active Go Unicode tables for every non-ASCII rune lowering to an ASCII query byte.\\n  - Excessive expansion fails closed to exhaustive search.\\n  - Differential regressions cover Kelvin sign and Turkish dotted I.\\n- Preserved lexical retrieval from oversized partial-failure files; no hidden exclusions.\\n\\nValidation:\\n\\n- `go test ./internal/gitutil ./internal/sem` passed.\\n- `mise run check` passed, including race tests; total 87.05s.\\n- `git diff --check` passed.\\n- No commit created.\\n\\nFresh-process warm timings, including the Unicode-table scan:\\n\\n- Narrow realistic query: **0.77s wall**, **762ms internal total**\\n  - Previous frozen binary: **3.151s**\\n  - 31 candidate files versus 265.\\n- Broad five-term query: **820ms internal total**.\\n- Exact no-hit: **0.23s wall**, **225ms internal total**, zero content reads.\\n\\nFiles modified:\\n\\n- `internal/gitutil/git.go`\\n- `internal/gitutil/git_test.go`\\n- `internal/sem/provider.go`\\n- `internal/sem/provider_test.go`\\n- `internal/sem/search.go`\\n- `internal/sem/search_cache.go`\\n- `internal/sem/search_test.go`\\n- `internal/sem/search_cache_test.go`\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
