{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T17:59:36.865Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"Graph checkpoint pushed: `1d0d97c` is now the exact head of PR #43. The final local suite passed on the committed bytes (race tests, vet, formatting, build), and all seven GitHub jobs have started.\n\nMeasured against the frozen old binary:\n\n- realistic warm query: 3.151s → 0.70s;\n- broad five-term warm query: ~3.6s → ~0.82s;\n- warm no-hit: 1.35s → 0.18–0.23s;\n- no hidden file cap, with Unicode and oversized-file differential recall preserved.\n\nI’m now hardening the benchmark adapter itself before committing it; its adversarial review found runtime-isolation defects that fake tests did not exercise, including blocking Claude’s own API transport and using an auth mode incompatible with copied OAuth. Those are runner defects, not Graph losses, and they will be fixed before any paid attempt.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T17:59:36.866Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bbf08d6d481919d7d0fb296ecd5d1","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Graph checkpoint pushed: `1d0d97c` is now the exact head of PR #43. The final local suite passed on the committed bytes (race tests, vet, formatting, build), and all seven GitHub jobs have started.\n\nMeasured against the frozen old binary:\n\n- realistic warm query: 3.151s → 0.70s;\n- broad five-term warm query: ~3.6s → ~0.82s;\n- warm no-hit: 1.35s → 0.18–0.23s;\n- no hidden file cap, with Unicode and oversized-file differential recall preserved.\n\nI’m now hardening the benchmark adapter itself before committing it; its adversarial review found runtime-isolation defects that fake tests did not exercise, including blocking Claude’s own API transport and using an auth mode incompatible with copied OAuth. Those are runner defects, not Graph losses, and they will be fixed before any paid attempt."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
