{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T18:30:21.968Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"I caught another real harness incompatibility before it reached execution: Claude 2.1.210 documents that `--safe-mode` disables MCP servers, so it cannot power the Graph or CBM arms. I’ve sent the correction: normal mode with an isolated home, no settings sources, strict explicit MCP config, explicit tool permissions, no slash commands/browser/session persistence, and native keychain auth. I’m validating that exact CLI behavior without contacting a model.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T18:30:21.968Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bc63def088191908c03254c360e64","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"I caught another real harness incompatibility before it reached execution: Claude 2.1.210 documents that `--safe-mode` disables MCP servers, so it cannot power the Graph or CBM arms. I’ve sent the correction: normal mode with an isolated home, no settings sources, strict explicit MCP config, explicit tool permissions, no slash commands/browser/session persistence, and native keychain auth. I’m validating that exact CLI behavior without contacting a model."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T18:30:21.990Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bc63df1688191a48a335fe59e919e","status":"completed","call_id":"call_8JjsAAXwEsPAqwl70L08zRrb","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: /private/tmp/claude-mcp-mode-probe.json\\n+{\\n+  \\\"mcpServers\\\": {\\n+    \\\"mode-probe\\\": {\\n+      \\\"type\\\": \\\"stdio\\\",\\n+      \\\"command\\\": \\\"/usr/bin/true\\\",\\n+      \\\"args\\\": []\\n+    }\\n+  }\\n+}\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\nconst r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd: \"mkdir -p /private/tmp/claude-mcp-mode-probe-home\",\n  workdir: \"/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph\",\n  yield_time_ms: 10000,\n  max_output_tokens: 1000\n});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
