{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T18:31:49.591Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The exact empty-home auth probe uncovered another concrete issue: normal-mode Claude cannot recover OAuth from the keychain with an entirely blank `HOME`; it returns `loggedIn=false`. I’m feeding that into the runner now. The secure options are either a read-denied real-home auth lookup or loading the OAuth token in the trusted controller and scrubbing it from every MCP child; the runner must prove one of those paths before it can pass preflight.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T18:31:49.591Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0bd6d73b974b1fab016a5bc6958c248191ab6c85be57205367","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The exact empty-home auth probe uncovered another concrete issue: normal-mode Claude cannot recover OAuth from the keychain with an entirely blank `HOME`; it returns `loggedIn=false`. I’m feeding that into the runner now. The secure options are either a read-denied real-home auth lookup or loading the OAuth token in the trusted controller and scrubbing it from every MCP child; the runner must prove one of those paths before it can pass preflight."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
